<title>USA: Citadel Environmental names new president.</title>
<headline>Citadel Environmental names new president.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citadel Environmental Group Inc said Tuesday it has named Richard Landi president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Landi replaces David Norris, who has become vice chairman of the board of directors.</p>
<p>The company said Landi's primary responsibility will be the reorganization of Citadel's operations in Arizona.  He also will lead the company's acquisition team.</p>
</text>
